#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/fps-filter-card.md:3
#: 7be6fe01cf9f44f9af0e9e2a083df557
msgid "代表性采样（FPS）（Representative Sampling (FPS)）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/fps-filter-card.md:5
#: aad2e5fd485a41c8b984aa4bd739a0a1
msgid "**分类：** 筛选与采样"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/fps-filter-card.md:7
#: 4e1cef24bc6e4bb6b2d0337567ffe144
msgid "功能说明"
msgstr "What the card does"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/fps-filter-card.md:9
#: d3ac1769318c4f339bec550a3838f92e
msgid ""
"基于结构级 NEP 均值描述符执行最远点采样（FPS），从大批量结构中挑选代表性子"
"集。需要提供一个 NEP 模型文件（如内置的 `nep89.txt` 或你自己训练的模型）用于"
"生成描述符。**代表性是相对于这个模型的描述符空间而言的**；换一个 NEP 模型，结"
"构间距离和最终选择都可能改变。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/fps-filter-card.md:11
#: 00a035fb9d634db5956bd051657fb8c7
msgid "卡片提供两种采样方式："
msgstr "The card provides two sampling strategies:"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/fps-filter-card.md:13
#: 5874076dc9d2490aa6e7eb3c756f177c
msgid ""
"`global`：兼容原有行为，对全部结构执行一次全局 FPS；没有已有训练集时固定从输"
"入第 1 个结构开始；"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/fps-filter-card.md:14
#: ec694121fa364bb8b0caa9aa4d18a584
msgid ""
"`element_set`：先按元素集合分组，每组至少获得一个名额，剩余名额按组大小的平方"
"根分配，再从组内中心开始 FPS。该模式仍使用原始结构均值描述符，不启用实验性的"
"分元素 mean/std 或 robust scaling。"
msgstr ""
"`element_set`: groups structures by element set, assigns at least one slot "
"per group, distributes the remaining slots by the square root of group size, "
"and starts FPS from each group center. This mode still uses the original "
"structure-mean descriptor and does not enable experimental per-element mean/"
"std features or robust scaling."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/fps-filter-card.md:16
#: 54e576e5211345518719b871565942d6
msgid "原理与公式"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/fps-filter-card.md:18
#: 7959bb9510a64ef4a89ad699f37b8688
msgid ""
"\\mathbf{d}_i=\\frac{1}{N_i}\\sum_{a=1}^{N_i}\\mathbf{d}_{ia}^{\\mathrm{NEP}}"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/fps-filter-card.md:20
#: 105f19b467de4d638d8233ca09ca89cc
msgid ""
"i_t=\\arg\\max_j\\ \\min_{i\\in S_{t-1}}\\lVert\\mathbf{d}_j-\\mathbf{d}"
"_i\\rVert_2,\\quad S_t=S_{t-1}\\cup\\{i_t\\}"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/fps-filter-card.md:22
#: d91882d5c60140688513a4f79f2cc018
msgid ""
"$\\mathbf d_{ia}^{\\mathrm{NEP}}$ 是原子描述符，$\\mathbf d_i$ 是结构级均值描"
"述符， $S_t$ 是第 $t$ 步已选集合。`最小距离`要求新代表点到已有集合的最近描述"
"符距离不低于 阈值；已有训练集会作为初始 $S_0$，使候选优先补训练集尚未覆盖的区"
"域。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/fps-filter-card.md:26
#: 2d4b24b3951a4a0184897f4fea4103e9
msgid "操作示例"
msgstr "Example workflow"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/fps-filter-card.md:28
#: 752be58967ad47e2ab9ba28514bddef5
msgid "场景：2000 个候选结构训练出来效果不如 200 个精选的"
msgstr "Scenario: 2,000 candidates perform worse than 200 selected structures"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/fps-filter-card.md:30
#: 1bd91d06175343a190abf2a7a0f0b6f8
msgid ""
"你用多张生成卡产出了 2000 个候选结构，全部丢进训练集跑了 DFT 计算。重训后模型"
"精度比只用前 200 个结构手动挑的版本还差——2000 个结构里大量重复构型，有效多样"
"性反而被稀释了。"
msgstr ""
"Several generators produce 2,000 candidates and all are labeled by DFT, yet "
"the retrained model is worse than one trained on 200 manually selected "
"structures. Heavy duplication diluted effective diversity."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/fps-filter-card.md:32
#: e0e7ee91d4bf4dec8fa589e0d05dd593
msgid ""
"**诊断思路：** 卡片生成的候选集有大量统计冗余。比如 `Random Vacancy` 生成了 "
"200 个空位结构，但从描述符角度看可能只有 15 种真正不同的局域环境。FPS 可以在"
"描述符空间里按\"最远优先\"的原则挑出最不相似的子集，保留多样性去掉冗余。"
msgstr ""
"**Diagnosis:** Generated pools often contain statistical redundancy: 200 "
"random vacancies may represent only 15 distinct local environments. FPS "
"greedily chooses points farthest from the selected set in descriptor space, "
"preserving diversity while removing near-duplicates."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/fps-filter-card.md:34
#: 5cbfd2d0be9a417a8fe0849feae8fd09
msgid "**输入：** 2000 个候选结构，以及一个可用的 `nep89.txt` 模型文件"
msgstr "**Input:** 2,000 cleaned candidates and a usable NEP model file."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/fps-filter-card.md:36
#: e5fb54b3f2e646268e20db18816b2ae0
msgid "**目标：** 从 2000 个中挑出 200 个最具代表性的结构"
msgstr "**Objective:** Select 200 representative structures."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/fps-filter-card.md:38
#: c3a41ea67bc4409e8cfe8c997457dc9d
msgid ""
"**参数设置：** `采样策略`选择“全局 FPS”，`描述符 NEP 模型`指向 NEP 模型， `最"
"多保留结构数`填 `200`，`描述符距离阈值`填 `0.01`。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/fps-filter-card.md:41
#: 5f6577d1ac334848b3b2e5c22b4b1d8c
msgid ""
"**输出：** 最多 200 个结构，以贪心最远点规则扩展描述符空间覆盖。FPS 不保证全"
"局最优，也不保证关键物性误差一定优于随机抽样。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/fps-filter-card.md:43
#: df8349006cb04b8b86799d41dd1718bc
msgid "**怎么验证挑选质量：**"
msgstr "**How to verify selection quality:**"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/fps-filter-card.md:44
#: 79725b1fc716478b8bd16ceae711a5a4
msgid ""
"重训后用同一组独立测试集比较 FPS 精选 200 个与随机抽取 200 个；不要预设 FPS "
"一定更好"
msgstr ""
"After retraining, compare the 200 FPS-selected structures with 200 random "
"structures on the same independent test set; do not assume FPS must be "
"better."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/fps-filter-card.md:45
#: 5fee78f4e6ea4057be977db7d36fd508
msgid "如果 200 个不够，增大 `num_condition` 到 500"
msgstr "If 200 is insufficient, increase `num_condition`, for example to 500."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/fps-filter-card.md:46
#: 72abd19e44834025bde3bea2d32b24c2
msgid "如果挑出的结构仍有重复感，增大 `min_distance_condition` 到 0.05~0.1"
msgstr ""
"If selected structures remain redundant, test a larger "
"`min_distance_condition`, such as 0.05-0.1."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/fps-filter-card.md:47
#: 6d017877bf114618b21b631322d71546
msgid "注意：FPS 只挑不造——如果输入池本身没有某类构型，FPS 不会凭空变出来"
msgstr ""
"FPS selects but never generates. A missing configuration family cannot "
"appear unless it exists in the input pool."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/fps-filter-card.md:49
#: aa914262efa042ac81ef0d78dd7764e4
msgid "场景：多个化学体系共用一个候选池"
msgstr "Scenario: multiple chemical systems share one candidate pool"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/fps-filter-card.md:51
#: b5ea27297060438583103d05b6fbfe2d
msgid ""
"候选池同时包含单质、二元和三元结构时，全局 FPS 会让所有结构竞争同一预算。如果"
"要求每种元素集合至少保留一个候选，可选择 `element_set`。例如 V、Co、Ni、V-"
"Co、V-Ni、Co-Ni 和 V-Co-Ni 会形成 7 个组；当 `n_samples < 7` 时卡片明确报错，"
"不静默漏组。"
msgstr ""
"When a candidate pool contains unary, binary, and ternary structures, global "
"FPS makes every structure compete for one budget. Choose `element_set` when "
"every element set must retain at least one candidate. For example, V, Co, "
"Ni, V-Co, V-Ni, Co-Ni, and V-Co-Ni form seven groups; if `n_samples < 7`, "
"the card raises an explicit error instead of silently omitting groups."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/fps-filter-card.md:53
#: 650fadc5549542c59c738260172d889b
msgid ""
"已有训练集可作为 warm start，卡片会优先选择当前训练集尚未覆盖的区域。"
"`global` 模式把全部已有结构作为距离起点；`element_set` 模式只比较元素集合相同"
"的已有结构。已有训练集不计入 `最多保留结构数`（`n_samples`）输出数量。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/fps-filter-card.md:55
#: c33522998b6f40ff8fc1baa3466211c6
msgid ""
"这里“元素集合”只看出现过哪些元素，不看化学计量比。例如 H₂O 和 H₂O₂ 都属于 "
"`{H, O}` 组。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/fps-filter-card.md:57
#: 48c5bd31cae24147872aec26251cc731
msgid "什么时候加这张卡、什么时候不加"
msgstr "When to add this card"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/fps-filter-card.md:59
#: 07303e4c31a74c718afea5f3a00e0eab
msgid "**加：**"
msgstr "**Add it when:**"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/fps-filter-card.md:60
#: ae356aa0e7b04ec198c6ab07fde08b1e
msgid "生成链条产生了大量结构（>500），需要去冗余"
msgstr ""
"A generation chain produced hundreds of structures and needs deduplication"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/fps-filter-card.md:61
#: 47745ede200e4fd5abd56e5c52540936
msgid "怀疑训练集有大量重复/高度相似的构型"
msgstr ""
"The pool likely contains many duplicate or highly similar configurations"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/fps-filter-card.md:62
#: 311f1470f5ba46f0b69205b9326152f6
msgid "需要在保持覆盖的前提下压缩训练集体积"
msgstr "The dataset must be compressed while retaining coverage"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/fps-filter-card.md:63
#: d7509ed3443f4a159772bc1af1f0f677
msgid "混合了多个元素集合，并要求每组都有明确预算"
msgstr ""
"The pool mixes multiple element sets and each group needs an explicit budget."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/fps-filter-card.md:65
#: 9371596549c24a33ae6ad07c52c98af6
msgid "**不加：**"
msgstr "**Do not add it when:**"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/fps-filter-card.md:66
#: 380c94df6241450aae179a239bed9369
msgid "还在生成阶段，结构数量很少（<50）"
msgstr "The pool is still small"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/fps-filter-card.md:67
#: 67cac1f678b8495ab2c63e9cef1c69c4
msgid "输入池本身还没经过物理清洗（如已用 NEP 预筛、剔除异常结构）"
msgstr "The input pool has not yet been physically cleaned"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/fps-filter-card.md:68
#: fa788c319a874a3cbec6d40ed7ba94dd
msgid "模型还没训练出来——FPS 需要一个可用的 NEP 模型来生成描述符"
msgstr "No suitable NEP model is available for descriptors"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/fps-filter-card.md:70
#: 9a8939e1765242b7833251a105d79a36
msgid "参数说明"
msgstr "Parameters"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/fps-filter-card.md:71
#: bbccd9e5708846ec9bb7e84894f37c4d
msgid "描述符 NEP 模型（nep_path）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/fps-filter-card.md:73
#: eccad75c3dc34807a117c2a3ebad7b75
msgid ""
"`str`。指向用于生成 NEP 描述符的模型文件，界面默认使用内置 `nep89.txt`。路径"
"为空或文件不存在时卡片直接报错。内置模型便于快速筛选；正式数据选择更适合使用"
"覆盖候选化学体系和局域环境的模型。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/fps-filter-card.md:75
#: d7ba8f66b3014f71a1f6c5d3b9f0a0cb
msgid "最多保留结构数（n_samples）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/fps-filter-card.md:77
#: 993cfd61e43c4cc6baf5260bf23db879
msgid ""
"`int`，默认 100。FPS 过滤后保留结构数的上限。这是输出数量，不是上游生成数量。"
"若候选数更少，最多保留全部候选；若距离阈值提前触发，实际输出也会少于该值。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/fps-filter-card.md:79
#: 30b7b4814e79447b8868c5ff5e53df8d
msgid "描述符距离阈值（min_distance）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/fps-filter-card.md:81
#: d0cdf8b3df2b426bb5293aa8687b26e5
msgid ""
"`float`，默认 0。描述符空间中的最小距离阈值，没有物理单位，而且数值尺度依赖 "
"NEP 模型。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/fps-filter-card.md:83
#: 77b84c808f834fb5a448714484bf9a4e
msgid "`0`：关闭距离提前停止，按数量上限选择；"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/fps-filter-card.md:84
#: a23cce6aaebf4816a58f0afbbfbdc91c
msgid "`>0`：下一个最远候选与已覆盖集合的距离低于该值时提前停止。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/fps-filter-card.md:86
#: a0a6b6e9389b492c88cbeba2ec381708
msgid ""
"值越大去重越激进，也越可能选不够目标数量。不要把某个模型上合适的阈值直接照搬"
"到另一个模型。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/fps-filter-card.md:88
#: f8c3d3aacacb4fbd80cddcd8247332bc
msgid "计算后端（backend）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/fps-filter-card.md:90
#: fc9919845c7447e6907ef5005f74048b
msgid ""
"`str`，默认 `'auto'`。描述符计算后端。正常保持 `auto` 让程序自己选可用的 NEP "
"后端；只有在你需要调试性能或对比后端差异时才手动指定。"
msgstr ""
"`str`, default `'auto'`. Descriptor backend. Keep automatic selection unless "
"diagnosing performance or backend differences."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/fps-filter-card.md:92
#: 54ca7ebb85db4a5ab5f1671170d5bd23
msgid "单批最大原子数（chunk_max_atoms）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/fps-filter-card.md:94
#: 94ca58780b7a4bbfa11c2847c5d4accb
msgid ""
"`int`，默认 100000。每个描述符计算分块允许的总原子数，CPU 和 CUDA 使用同一语"
"义。显存或内存不足时调小；它不是结构数量，同一分块中所有结构的原子数之和不能"
"超过该值。"
msgstr ""
"`int`, default 100000. Maximum total atom count in each descriptor "
"calculation chunk, with the same meaning on CPU and CUDA. Reduce it when "
"device or host memory is insufficient. This is not a structure count; it "
"limits the sum of atoms across all structures in the chunk."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/fps-filter-card.md:96
#: f6afe47a336542848cc29bf9eb1f7996
msgid "采样方式（strategy）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/fps-filter-card.md:98
#: 3a929fffcb3c4151b170cd5c6b75d830
msgid "`str`，默认 `\"global\"`。可选值："
msgstr "`str`, default `\"global\"`. Available values:"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/fps-filter-card.md:0
#: 3cdbb4ed0d784a75a16089cb27911eaa
msgid "值"
msgstr "Value"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/fps-filter-card.md:0
#: 29edfce5c32f4ec4a91b85496a05af35
msgid "行为"
msgstr "Behavior"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/fps-filter-card.md:0
#: a23c0969949d4dee913405b0ef115fc4
msgid "`global`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/fps-filter-card.md:0
#: 5c16b5e95673481299dee4b122c6f42b
msgid "兼容旧流程；全部结构共享一个预算，没有 warm start 时从输入索引 0 开始"
