#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/fps-filter-card.md:151
#: 296760f560b54965832d0f5fe42cf977
msgid "多分支汇总后 → `FPS Filter`：先汇总各分支输出，再统一挑选"
msgstr ""
"Merged branch outputs -> `FPS Filter`: select across all branches "
"consistently"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/fps-filter-card.md:153
#: 6aa54606c6664b949317c4c89f1c6d66
msgid "常见问题"
msgstr "Common questions"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/fps-filter-card.md:155
#: 3d4cd76f20d0490db4f00d0d33d27bf2
msgid ""
"**卡片报错\"NEP file does not exist\"。** `描述符 NEP 模型`（`nep_path`）指向"
"的文件不存在。确认路径正确。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/fps-filter-card.md:157
#: 823962821749431bbf099d7305ec95e7
msgid ""
"**输出数量远小于目标上限。** 描述符距离阈值太严，无法选出足够多满足距离约束的"
"结构。降低该阈值，或设为 0 只按数量停止。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/fps-filter-card.md:159
#: 6c86907b27ab4f62946a89f4d5d6e430
msgid ""
"**平衡模式提示目标数量不足。** `最多保留结构数`（`n_samples`）小于元素集合组"
"数。提高目标数量，或者在上游移除本轮不需要的化学体系。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/fps-filter-card.md:161
#: befdec2753b346eca6a0d5a35d4720dd
msgid ""
"**已有训练集没有改变结果。** warm start 只比较元素集合相同的结构。检查候选池"
"与已有训练集的元素集合是否一致，并确认所用 NEP 模型支持这些元素。"
msgstr ""
"**The existing training set does not change the result.** The warm start "
"compares only structures with matching element sets. Check that the "
"candidate pool and existing training set use consistent element sets and "
"that the NEP model supports those elements."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/fps-filter-card.md:163
#: 393e3f9e9e914bd7956022f29106cecd
msgid ""
"**挑出的结构覆盖不全。** FPS 只能从现有池里选。如果某些局域环境在输入池里本来"
"就没有，FPS 也无法补充。回到上游增加生成多样性。"
msgstr ""
"**Coverage remains incomplete.** FPS cannot create absent environments. Add "
"the missing diversity upstream."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/fps-filter-card.md:165
#: 3aafdcf8b90d43aaa6c279ce51734043
msgid ""
"**描述符计算很慢。** 大批量时描述符计算可能耗时。`单批最大原子数`"
"（`chunk_max_atoms`）控制单批总原子数；它不是最终 FPS 的分块采样参数，减小它"
"只降低计算峰值内存，不会改变选择算法。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/fps-filter-card.md:167
#: b6f467b65d0b47e882e0474ac51f2925
msgid "输出标签"
msgstr "Output labels"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/fps-filter-card.md:169
#: a4c779c603a0414ebb83c146b98a615c
msgid "不新增专用 Config_type 标签。输出结构保留原标签。"
msgstr ""
"No dedicated `Config_type` is added; selected structures preserve their "
"existing labels."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/fps-filter-card.md:171
#: cd38e03c0a7343c9ad7164ff78d3c3e3
msgid "可复现性"
msgstr "Reproducibility"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/fps-filter-card.md:173
#: b44b9e30dc5d46cc951162c4129fb7cd
msgid ""
"无随机性。同参数同输入会得到一致输出。`global` 模式保留原有索引 0 起点，因此"
"改变输入顺序可能改变选择；`element_set` 从各组描述符中心开始，对输入顺序更稳"
"定。特征完全相同的近重复结构仍可能互换原始索引，但覆盖等价。"
msgstr ""
"There is no randomness: identical inputs and parameters produce identical "
"output. `global` retains the original index-0 starting point, so reordering "
"the input may change the selection; `element_set` starts from each group "
"descriptor center and is more stable to input order. Near-duplicate "
"structures with identical features may exchange original indices, but their "
"coverage is equivalent."

#~ msgid "FPS 过滤（FPS Filter）"
#~ msgstr "FPS Filter"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "基于结构级 NEP 均值描述符执行最远点采样（FPS），从大批量结构中挑选代表性子"
#~ "集。需要提供一个 NEP 模型文件（如内置的 `nep89.txt` 或你自己训练的模型）用"
#~ "于生成描述符。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Run farthest-point sampling (FPS) on structure-level mean NEP descriptors "
#~ "to select a representative subset from a large structure pool. Provide a "
#~ "NEP model file, such as the bundled `nep89.txt` or your own trained "
#~ "model, to generate descriptors."

#~ msgid "`global`：兼容原有行为，对全部结构执行一次全局 FPS；"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`global`: preserves the original behavior and runs one global FPS pass "
#~ "over all structures;"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "**参数设置：** `strategy=\"global\"`，`nep_path` 指向 NEP 模型，"
#~ "`n_samples=200`，`min_distance=0.01`。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**Parameters:** set `strategy=\"global\"`, point `nep_path` to a NEP "
#~ "model, use `n_samples=200`, and set `min_distance=0.01`."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "**输出：** 200 个结构，在描述符空间中两两距离尽可能大，覆盖输入集的多样性"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**Output:** Up to 200 structures chosen to spread coverage through the "
#~ "input descriptor space."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "已有训练集可作为 warm start。只有元素集合相同的已有结构才参与候选距离初始"
#~ "化，卡片会优先选择当前训练集尚未覆盖的区域。已有训练集不计入 `n_samples` "
#~ "输出数量。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "An existing training set can be used as a warm start. Only existing "
#~ "structures with the same element set initialize candidate distances, so "
#~ "the card prioritizes regions not yet covered by the training set. "
#~ "Existing structures do not count toward the `n_samples` output."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "`str`，默认 `MISSING`。指向用于生成 NEP 描述符的模型文件，必须是一个可用"
#~ "的 NEP 模型文件（如 `nep.txt` 或内置 `nep89.txt`）。路径为空或文件不存在时"
#~ "卡片直接报错。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`str`, default `MISSING`. Path to a usable NEP model such as `nep.txt` or "
#~ "bundled `nep89.txt`. The card fails if the path is empty or nonexistent."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "`int`，默认 100。FPS 过滤后保留的代表结构数。这是输出数量，不是上游生成数"
#~ "量——DFT 预算固定时直接设你计划算的上限；但设太小会把稀有构型也筛掉。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`int`, default `100`. Maximum representative outputs. It is an output "
#~ "count, not an upstream generation count. Match it to the DFT budget while "
#~ "leaving enough capacity for rare families."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "`float`，默认 0.01。描述符空间中的最小距离阈值。值越大去重越激进，但设太"
#~ "大 FPS 会过早停、选不够数；设太小又可能混入近重复结构。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`float`, default `0.01`. Minimum distance in descriptor space. Larger "
#~ "values deduplicate more aggressively but can stop before reaching the "
#~ "requested count; smaller values admit near-duplicates."

#~ msgid "兼容旧流程；全部结构执行一次全局 FPS，从输入索引 0 开始"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Preserves the legacy workflow; runs one global FPS pass over all "
#~ "structures starting from input index 0."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "`str`，默认空字符串。仅 `strategy=\"element_set\"` 使用。指向已有 `.xyz` "
#~ "或 `.extxyz` 训练集，作为同元素集合内的 warm start。路径不存在、无法读取或"
#~ "不含结构时明确报错；`global` 模式忽略界面中隐藏的旧路径并序列化为空字符"
#~ "串。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`str`, empty by default. Used only with `strategy=\"element_set\"`. Point "
#~ "it to an existing `.xyz` or `.extxyz` training set as a warm start within "
#~ "matching element sets. Missing, unreadable, or empty paths raise explicit "
#~ "errors; `global` mode ignores hidden legacy paths and serializes an empty "
#~ "string."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "任意生成链 → `NEP Dataset Display` 清洗 → `FPS Filter`：先去掉明显坏结构，"
#~ "再做代表性筛选"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Any generation chain -> clean in `NEP Dataset Display` -> `FPS Filter`: "
#~ "remove invalid geometry before representative sampling"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "**卡片报错\"NEP file does not exist\"。** `nep_path` 指向的文件不存在。确"
#~ "认路径正确。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**`NEP file does not exist`.** Correct `nep_path` to an existing model "
#~ "file."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "**输出数量远小于 `num_condition`。** `min_distance_condition` 太严，无法选"
#~ "出足够多满足距离约束的结构。降低该阈值。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**Output is far below `num_condition`.** `min_distance_condition` is too "
#~ "strict; lower it to allow more selections."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "**平衡模式提示目标数量不足。** `n_samples` 小于元素集合组数。提高目标数"
#~ "量，或者在上游移除本轮不需要的化学体系。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**Balanced mode reports an insufficient target count.** `n_samples` is "
#~ "smaller than the number of element-set groups. Increase the target or "
#~ "remove chemical systems that are not needed in this run upstream."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "**描述符计算很慢。** 大批量（>5000）时描述符计算可能耗时。先用 `FPS "
#~ "Filter` 之前控制好上游输出量。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**Descriptor calculation is slow.** Pools above several thousand "
#~ "structures can be expensive. Bound upstream generation and tune batch "
#~ "size before sampling."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "`int`，默认 1000。描述符批处理大小，只影响吞吐和内存。GPU 或大体系可以调大"
#~ "加速，内存紧张时适当调小。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`int`, default `1000`. Descriptor batch size; affects throughput and "
#~ "memory only. Increase when the backend and memory allow, and reduce under "
#~ "memory pressure."

#~ msgid "**参数设置：**"
#~ msgstr "**Parameters:**"

#~ msgid "`Nep Path` = 指向你的 NEP 模型文件路径"
#~ msgstr "`Nep Path` = path to the NEP model"

#~ msgid "轻度去重（保留 100 个，min_dist 0.01）"
#~ msgstr "Light deduplication (keep 100, min_dist 0.01)"

#~ msgid "常规去重（保留 200 个，min_dist 0.03）"
#~ msgstr "Routine deduplication (keep 200, min_dist 0.03)"

#~ msgid "强去重（保留 50 个，min_dist 0.06）"
#~ msgstr "Strong deduplication (keep 50, min_dist 0.06)"

#~ msgid "无随机性。同参数同输入 → 严格一致输出。FPS 是确定性贪心算法。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Deterministic: identical inputs and parameters produce identical output "
#~ "because FPS is a deterministic greedy algorithm."
